 Patch 1: patch1  ┃ Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the
source lines quoted in the patches.

═════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES              *
═════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that
patch. A sign-less line with one
number is an edit both patches make:
a new number means both add it, an
old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│foo.c    ┃ old new│foo.c
        │@@       ┃        │@@
   8   8│line8    ┃   8   8│line8
   9   9│line9    ┃   9   9│line9
  10    │line10   ┃  10    │line10
+     10│P1_line10┃+     10│P2_line10
  11  11│line11   ┃  11  11│line11
  12  12│line12   ┃  12  12│line12
        │         ┃  13  13│line13
        │─────────╂────────┼─────────
        │@@       ┃        │@@
        │         ┃  17  17│line17
        │         ┃  18  18│line18
  19  19│line19   ┃  19  19│line19
  20  20│line20   ┃- 20    │line20
        │         ┃+     20│P2_line20
  21  21│line21   ┃  21  21│line21
  22  22│line22   ┃  22  22│line22
- 23    │line23   ┃        │
+     23│P1_line23┃        │

═════════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES            *
═════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only one
result: - patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
